I am standing near the door.
Asha is with me.
The new key is in my hand.
I put the key in the lock.
I open the door.
We go inside.
This is my new living room.
There is a lot of light in the room.
I look all around.
All the furniture is placed here.
There is a big sofa in the room.
There is a fan above the sofa.
There is a small table near the sofa.
A beautiful lamp is kept on the table.
A box is lying under the table.
A carpet is lying on the floor.
There is a new clock on the wall.
The door is now closed behind me.
I am very happy.
